   "source": [
    "Building the model\n",
    "- the model is of the form X(t) = a + bt + sum(C(k)sin(2pi * k * t) + D(k)cos(2pi * k * t)) for\n",
    "values of k\n",
    "- this matrix 'H' is designed such that row t of H multiplied by the coefficients of the model\n",
    "you get the value at time t"
   ],
   "id": "cee0f2fc4f242f29"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-09-24T13:28:31.504376Z",
     "start_time": "2026-09-24T13:28:31.496767Z"
    }
   },
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "def Build_Matrix(t, K,P,trend):\n",
    "    n = len(t)\n",
    "    cols = [np.ones(n)]          # intercept column\n",
    "    if trend:\n",
    "        cols.append(t.astype(float))  # linear trend term\n",
    "    for k in range(1, K + 1):\n",
    "        cols.append(np.sin(2 * np.pi * k * t / P))\n",
    "        cols.append(np.cos(2 * np.pi * k * t / P))\n",
    "    return np.column_stack(cols)\n"
   ],
   "id": "6657356970e214e1",
   "outputs": [],
   "execution_count": 29
  },
  {
   "metadata": {},
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": "- Bellow is a Class dedicated to cleaning the values that my model can call",
   "id": "55296b63197469d7"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {
